Testing that the hardware offload flowtable lists the WDS station ports of a
wireless bridge member by name prefix, in place of the ports that exist at
the time of the render. A wireless member whose name leaves no room for a
port name gets no prefix. Name prefixes need Linux 6.17 or later.

-- Testcase --
{%
	fw4.load(false);
	print(fw4.resolve_offload_devices(), "\n");
%}
-- End --

